I don't know.
我不知道。

00:05:40.589 --> 00:05:42.269
They sometimes end in H, but there's a case.
它们有时以H结尾，不过这里面有原因。

00:05:42.269 --> 00:05:43.110
Oh, there's a case.
哦，有原因的。

00:05:43.110 --> 00:05:43.949
Of course.
当然。

00:05:43.949 --> 00:05:44.790
Yeah.
对。

00:05:44.790 --> 00:05:45.790
There's something.
肯定有什么原因。

00:05:45.790 --> 00:05:48.709
So this episode is called Bachelor Party, who wrote this episode?
所以这一集叫“单身派对”，谁写的这一集？

00:05:48.709 --> 00:05:49.550
Yes.
对。

00:05:49.550 --> 00:05:54.389
Greg Thomas and Cliff Baze.
格雷格·托马斯和克利夫·贝恩斯。

00:05:54.389 --> 00:06:08.633
I wrote this, it aired by the way, I want to point out on what's, what's for April, April, April 9, 2007, which means three weeks after episode 18.
我写了这个，顺便说一句，它是播出的，我想指出是在什么时候，4月几号，4月9日，2007年，也就是第18集的三周后。

00:06:08.633 --> 00:06:13.089
Craig, there was a three, that is a great gap.
克雷格，这中间隔了三周，这间隔可真够长的。

00:06:13.089 --> 00:06:14.228
You know what that was?
你知道那是为什么吗？

00:06:14.228 --> 00:06:16.108
Let me see and think of what that was.
让我想想那是什么时候。

00:06:16.108 --> 00:06:17.147
March Madness on CBS.
CBS电视台的疯狂三月（NCAA篮球锦标赛）。

00:06:17.147 --> 00:06:18.483
I bet that's what that was.
我敢打赌那就是原因。

00:06:18.483 --> 00:06:21.649
I bet there was a bunch of games and we got preempted on Monday.
我敢说当时有一堆比赛，我们在周一被插播的节目给顶替了。

00:06:21.649 --> 00:06:26.649
Do you like some special tailored March Madness promos?
你喜欢那种特别定制的疯狂三月宣传片吗？

00:06:26.930 --> 00:06:27.769
We did, yeah.
我们拍过，是的。

00:06:27.769 --> 00:06:30.170
We would have to shoot March Madness promos.
我们得拍疯狂三月的主题宣传片。

00:06:30.170 --> 00:06:38.129
We did March Madness themed episodes sometimes, but often we'd also get preempted, or maybe it was just rerun nights, but yeah, and March was a bit of a dead zone.
我们有时会拍疯狂三月主题的剧集，但通常也会被节目顶替，或者可能只是重播之夜，不过是的，三月确实有点像播出淡季。

00:06:38.129 --> 00:06:39.649
Three weeks is a long time.
三周是很长的一段时间。

00:06:39.649 --> 00:06:41.050
That is a while between the two.
这两集之间隔得确实挺久。

00:06:41.050 --> 00:06:46.170
But I do remember my basketball loving friends saying, seeing a lot of your commercials.
但我记得我那些喜欢篮球的朋友说，经常能看到你们的广告。

00:06:46.170 --> 00:06:51.730
We had to embrace NCAA basketball as a show in a huge way that was beyond, Carter and I don't give a fuck about it.
我们作为一部剧，不得不大力拥抱NCAA篮球，这种程度远远超出了……我和卡特根本不在乎这玩意儿。

00:06:51.730 --> 00:06:56.009
And see, I'm like, sorry, everybody, I turn you to NCAA fans, we don't really care about it.
而且你看，我就像是，对不起各位，我把你们变成了NCAA球迷，其实我们根本不在乎。

00:06:56.009 --> 00:06:59.730
And we, but we were forced to embrace it as the sort of like corporate synergy strategy.
我们，但我们被迫去拥抱它，作为一种类似于企业协同的策略。

00:06:59.730 --> 00:07:00.569
So we, so we did.
所以我们，我们照做了。

00:07:00.569 --> 00:07:02.170
And we got that great bracket episode out of it.
而且我们还因此得到了那集精彩的晋级表（Bracket）剧集。

00:07:02.170 --> 00:07:03.170
So I don't have brackets.
所以我没有预测晋级表。

00:07:03.170 --> 00:07:04.009
It's a great episode.
那是一集很棒的剧。

00:07:04.009 --> 00:07:07.810
It was definitely not our natural setting to get obsessed about NCAA.
要对NCAA入迷，这绝对不是我们的自然状态。

00:07:07.810 --> 00:07:08.810
Yeah.
是的。

00:07:08.810 --> 00:07:11.569
So this aired, yeah, three week break.
所以这一集播出时，对，中间有三周的空档。

00:07:11.569 --> 00:07:13.370
And you guys wrote this.
你们俩写了这一集。

00:07:13.370 --> 00:07:14.209
You wrote it.
你们写的。

00:07:14.209 --> 00:07:15.329
We wrote Carter and I wrote it.
我们写的，卡特和我写的。

00:07:15.329 --> 00:07:18.649
I sort of forgot that was true until about halfway through the episode.
我差不多到了这一集进行到一半时才想起来确实如此。

00:07:18.649 --> 00:07:23.269
It's such a weird thing, 19 years later, because we got our hands on a lot of these episodes.
19年后再看这事真是太奇怪了，因为我们经手过很多这样的剧集。

00:07:23.269 --> 00:07:28.990
A lot of these episodes, like, sometimes we take one and put, sort of it would go through our computer before we'd bring it into the room.
很多这样的剧集，比如，有时我们会拿下一集，在把它带进编剧室之前，先让它过一下我们的电脑。

00:07:28.990 --> 00:07:35.389
It's very, I've really forgotten some of them that we technically started off ourselves, but yeah.
这感觉很奇妙，有些剧我们技术上确实是自己开的头，但我真的已经忘光了，不过是的。

00:07:35.389 --> 00:07:37.629
But it was a delight, this was very fun one.
但这是一部让人开心的作品，这一集非常有趣。

00:07:37.629 --> 00:07:43.790
I think Carter probably took the first run at this one, and so it's maybe a little more, a little more Carter Bay is than me, this one.
我想卡特大概是这一集的第一个执笔人，所以这一集可能比我更有卡特的风格。

00:07:43.790 --> 00:07:44.629
That's sicko.
真是个变态。

00:07:44.629 --> 00:07:46.470
Yeah, I know.
对，我知道。

00:07:46.470 --> 00:07:47.310
Where's sicko?
变态在哪儿？

